marize the recent weather forecast situations for major global ports.", "output": "The recent weather forecast for major ports worldwide is rather complex, with extreme meteorological phenomena such as high winds, surge, rainfall, and low temperatures in some areas. It is necessary to pay attention to weather forecasts and take corresponding measures to ensure the safety of ships and personnel."}{"task_type": "Judgment", "input": "Has the current state of marine pollution already sparked widespread social concern?", "output": "Yes, the pollution of the marine environment has attracted widespread social attention, and regulatory efforts and remediation measures are being intensified."}\n{"task_type": "Open-ended Generation", "input": "Elaborate on the impact of the development and utilization of marine green resources on economic development.", "output": "The development and utilization of oceanic green resources can bring about the following economic benefits: 1. Increase marine output value and promote the development of new types of industries; 2. Improve product quality and market competitiveness; 3. Expand employment opportunities, stimulate economic growth and improve people\'s livelihood; 4. Promote the protection of the ocean and the advancement of scientific research."}\n', 'reference': 'According to the weather forecast and marine environment conditions, it is expected that there will be a northeast wind of level 3-4 in the sea for the next two days, causing significant waves. Boat safety is highly recommended. In addition, the wind and waves may impact the nearshore areas, potentially changing the current of the water. We advise fishermen and tourists to prepare well in advance for their safety.'}{'question': 'Describe the current status of the marine environment in your city and the major pollution problems.', 'answer': '\n\nThe provided context does not specify the marine environment status of a particular city, so I cannot address city-specific details.