gen production) are expected to expand market potential.  \n\nThe context mentions that future technological improvements will broaden the industry’s prospects, aligning with global decarbonization goals. For deeper technical specifics, further specialized resources would be required.  \n\n*Note: This synthesis combines the provided context with general knowledge, as the database lacks detailed technical data on offshore wind power systems.*', 'contexts': 'n purposes.", "output": "After calculation, 1km/h is approximately equal to 0.28m/s. You can use this value for subsequent comparison and analysis."}\n{"task_type": "Editing", "input": "Write an article introducing the current status and development prospects of offshore wind power stations.", "output": "Offshore wind power stations are an emerging clean energy source, and have been widely employed around the world. In the future, with the further improvement of technology, the offshore wind energy industry will embrace broader market space and development prospects."}{"task_type": "Commonsense Reasoning", "input": "Speculate whether there is a risk of the undersea pipeline in the east china sea being damaged.", "output": "The construction of undersea pipelines in the East Sea area is massive, facing a multitude of unpredictable risks. Even though the current implementation and maintenance mechanism for these pipelines is relatively mature, there theoretically exists the risk of the pipelines being affected by unpredictable factors such as natural disasters."}\n{"task_type": "Extraction", "input": "Extract the abstract from the 5th article of the 3rd issue of the \\"marine chemistry\\" journal in 2019.", "output": "Abstract: Research has found significant variations in the bacterial communities in the central Atlantic. The impact of these bacteria on marine ecosystems requires further exploration."}\n', 'reference': '【Oceanic Wind Power Generation Technology】Oceanic wind power generation technology refers to a new